cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PUMPS, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "PUMPS: Probabilistic Unsupervised Membership & Parameter Sampling for Gaia open clusters"
abstract: >-
  An integrated, calibrated Bayesian Python pipeline for identifying and
  characterizing open clusters in Gaia data: HDBSCAN pseudo-probability
  membership with Bayesian PM/parallax refinement, Bayesian King structural
  fitting, NUTS Poisson-Hess isochrone fitting, and dynamical diagnostics,
  with ArviZ InferenceData provenance for every fit.
type: software
